Name:         qlc
Version:      0.1.0
Synopsis:     C wrappers for QuantLib library
Description:  Low-level C wrappers for QuantLib library, for use with quantlib package.
License:      BSD3
License-File: LICENSE
Author:       Sergey Khorev <sergey.khorev@gmail.com>
Maintainer:   Sergey Khorev <sergey.khorev@gmail.com>
Copyright:    Sergey Khorev 2012-2013

Category:     Finance
Cabal-Version:>=1.2
Tested-With:  GHC==7.4.2, GHC==7.6.2
--Homepage:
Build-type:   Custom

Extra-source-files:
              cpp/qlBond.cpp
              cpp/qlCalendar.cpp
